  "title": "Kansas Vigilant Guard - Tornado Response Simulation",
  "description": "Soldiers of the Missouri and West Virginia National Guard collaborated with other Guard and civilian forces during Kansas Vigilant Guard, hosted in Salina.  Response teams suited up for a real-life mock tornado disaster in the rubble of Crisis City.  Teams of Soldiers and Airmen included CBRN personnel who confirmed the area's atmosphere safe before medical teams evacuated and treated casualties.  This event is one of several simulations tasked to Soldiers such as train derailment and civil disturbance scenarios.",
